1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,705
Now solve the cold open.

2
00:00:01,705 --> 00:00:06,679
Scratch both sheets, and water bridges the coating and the exposed iron.

3
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:12,057
A second galvanic cell forms, and the more reactive metal becomes the anode.

4
00:00:12,057 --> 00:00:21,744
Look at the electrochemical series: zinc minus zero point seven six, iron minus zero point four four, tin minus zero point one four.

